**Displacement**

\[
s = u\,t + \frac12 a t^{2}
   = 5\,\text{m/s}\times10\,\text{s}
     + \frac12(2\,\text{m/s}^{2})(10\,\text{s})^{2}
   = 50 + 100
   = 150\;\text{m}
\]

Rounded to two decimal places: **150.00 m**

---

**Final speed**

\[
v_f = u + a t
    = 5\,\text{m/s} + 2\,\text{m/s}^{2}\times10\,\text{s}
    = 5 + 20
    = 25\;\text{m/s}
\]

Rounded to two decimal places: **25.00 m/s**
